The Magical Crimes Convox is a department within the [[Org/Iridescent Church/index|Iridescent Church]] devoted to solving the unexplained and the weird when they negatively impact the [[Iridescent Host|Host's]] people. Some cases they've worked on previously have included a mysterious curse originating from the [[Verdant Expanse]] and an everlasting rain from excessive augury.

The convox is headquartered at 33 Rook's Crossing in the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Aurideon/index|Aurideon]].

The convox sent three of its members to [[Geography/Calaria/Wrenford|Wrenford]] to trace a killer who left forty-eight dead in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], dried to husks in their beds: [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/People/Mickey Ironroots|Mickey Ironroots]], [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/People/Cedric Corot|Cedric Corot]], and [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/People/Krod Snodman|Krod Snodman]]. The Church reimburses the travel of its investigators.
